e] = { { name, idx, kind } } }`, riding the same-file helper worklist; a method call to a `M.f(self, …)` shifts by the receiver), the callee's file joins the scope, and it runs again until no new seed appears. Value: `{ rounds, fixpoint, seeds, derefs, by_path, files, sites, unresolved }` — a call the graph did NOT resolve is a NAMED row (`file:line callee`), never a silent stop. ⚠ The call records count lines from 0, the roster from 1. MEASURED 2026-10-03 (seed: the `at` field, scope the algebra's files): fixpoint in 3 rounds, 6 cross-file parameter seeds, 37 deref sites in 5 files, 26 unresolved calls named; 55 s, mostly the graph's extraction. ⚠ A bare field name (`at`) also matches unrelated records' fields — root it (`rooted=`) where a producer has a stable base. CART-1345 |"},"verb":"edit"},"id":"1791022534.082771-edit"}],"hand":0}
